  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help a Poor Crippled Orphan to Live &amp; Stay Healthy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Miss Blessing, a 20-year-old poor crippled orphan, to take good care of herself and also continue receiving medical treatment. Blessing suddenly became crippled alongside her mother 7 years ago, and both were confined to a wheelchair since then. Her mother died recently on February 19 and this is worsening blessing&apos;s already bad state of health. Your support is needed as plans are under way to take her to a good hospital outside Nigeria, for  better medical treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
